# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF（Windows 上默认 autocrlf 会把源码写成 CRLF，导致跨平台全是"已修改"）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 文档与脚本按文本处理
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.nsh text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
